{
  "name": "VSCode Project Maintenance Audit",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 6
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "schedule-trigger",
      "name": "Schedule Every 6 Hours",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [250, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "command": "pwsh",
        "arguments": "-NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File \"C:\\Users\\dylan.a.thomas\\Projects\\VSCode_March26\\.vscode\\scripts\\mcp-healthcheck.ps1\""
      },
      "id": "check-mcp-health",
      "name": "Check MCP Health",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeCommand",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [450, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "command": "pwsh",
        "arguments": "-NoProfile -Command \"& { Get-ChildItem -Path 'C:\\Users\\dylan.a.thomas\\Projects\\VSCode_March26' -Recurse -File | Where-Object { $_.LastWriteTime -gt (Get-Date).AddHours(-6) } | Select-Object -First 20 | ForEach-Object { $_.FullName } } | ConvertTo-Json\""
      },
      "id": "check-recent-changes",
      "name": "Get Recent File Changes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeCommand",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [650, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "command": "git",
        "arguments": "-C \"C:\\Users\\dylan.a.thomas\\Projects\\VSCode_March26\" status --porcelain"
      },
      "id": "check-git-status",
      "name": "Check Git Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeCommand",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [850, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "filePath": "C:\\Users\\dylan.a.thomas\\Projects\\VSCode_March26\\.serena\\memories\\audit-log.md",
        "fileContent": "=## Audit Report - {{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss') }}\n\n**MCP Health Check:**\n``` \n{{ $node[\"Check MCP Health\"].json.stdout }}\n```\n\n**Recent Changes (last 6 hours):**\n```\n{{ $node[\"Get Recent File Changes\"].json.stdout }}\n```\n\n**Git Status:**\n```\n{{ $node[\"Check Git Status\"].json.stdout }}\n```\n\n**Analysis:**\n- Total MCP servers checked: 4\n- Status: {{ $node[\"Check MCP Health\"].json.stderr ? 'Issues detected' : 'All healthy' }}\n- Files modified: {{ $node[\"Get Recent File Changes\"].json.stdout ? 'Yes' : 'No recent changes' }}\n- Git changes: {{ $node[\"Check Git Status\"].json.stdout ? 'Uncommitted changes present' : 'Clean working directory' }}\n\n---\n\n",
        "options": {
          "append": true
        }
      },
      "id": "write-audit-log",
      "name": "Write Audit Log",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.readWriteFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1050, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Parse the MCP health check output\nconst healthOutput = $input.first().json.stdout;\nconst hasIssues = healthOutput.includes('[!]') || healthOutput.includes('[X]');\n\n// Parse recent changes\nconst recentChanges = JSON.parse($node[\"Get Recent File Changes\"].json.stdout || '[]');\nconst changedFileCount = recentChanges.length;\n\n// Parse git status\nconst gitStatus = $node[\"Check Git Status\"].json.stdout;\nconst uncommittedChanges = gitStatus ? gitStatus.split('\\n').length : 0;\n\n// Determine if notification is needed\nconst needsAttention = hasIssues || uncommittedChanges > 10 || changedFileCount > 50;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    needsAttention,\n    hasIssues,\n    changedFileCount,\n    uncommittedChanges,\n    timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\n    message: needsAttention \n      ? `⚠️ Project needs attention: ${hasIssues ? 'MCP issues, ' : ''}${uncommittedChanges} uncommitted changes, ${changedFileCount} files modified` \n      : '✅ Project healthy: All systems operational'\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "analyze-results",
      "name": "Analyze Results",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1250, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "boolean": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.needsAttention }}",
              "value2": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "needs-attention",
      "name": "Needs Attention?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1450, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "filePath": "C:\\Users\\dylan.a.thomas\\Projects\\VSCode_March26\\.serena\\memories\\alert-required.txt",
        "fileContent": "={{ $json.message }}\n\nTimestamp: {{ $json.timestamp }}\nMCP Issues: {{ $json.hasIssues }}\nFiles Changed: {{ $json.changedFileCount }}\nUncommitted: {{ $json.uncommittedChanges }}\n\n---\nAction Required: Review project status and resolve issues.",
        "options": {
          "append": false
        }
      },
      "id": "write-alert",
      "name": "Write Alert File",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.readWriteFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1650, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "no-action-needed",
      "name": "No Action Needed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1650, 400]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
